00:28:17.970 --> 00:28:19.291
- [Gene] Right there.

00:28:19.291 --> 00:28:20.124
(hopeful music)

00:28:20.124 --> 00:28:22.030
I was just chasing everything.

00:28:22.030 --> 00:28:24.697
(hopeful music)

00:28:47.670 --> 00:28:51.270
- Fireworks are this perfect
combination of chemistry,

00:28:51.270 --> 00:28:53.280
light, and sound.

00:28:53.280 --> 00:28:56.310
If their purpose is to banish bad spirits,

00:28:56.310 --> 00:28:58.478
